Stock Market mobile app following Agile/Scrum, our team leveraged Flutter (Dart), Android Studio for app to implement real‑time stock and crypto market snapshots with news feeds, interactive historical charts, portfolio management, geolocation‑based services, and a premium Pro upgrade. The app empowers users to stay seamlessly connected to global markets

Tools and Techonologies:
-Development Environment: Android Studio
-Flutter & Dart: UI toolkit and language for cross‑platform development.
-REST & WebSockets:
--HTTP/REST calls for fetching historical and on‑demand data.
--WebSocket streams for real‑time price updates.
-JSON: Payload format for all API communication.

